{
  "slug": "octopus",
  "name": "Octopus",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-powered code review in Claude Code, powered by Octopus. Review PRs with natural language or slash commands, automatically fix review comments from the Octopus bot, and get security, bug, and code quality analysis — all without leaving your terminal.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 command**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `autofix` (Check open PRs for Octopus review comments, apply fixes, and push updates), `code-review` (AI-powered code review using Octopus)\n- **Agents** (1): `code-reviewer` (Specialized Octopus code review agent)\n- **Commands** (1): `review`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install octopus@claude-community` from `octopusreview/claude-plugin`.",
